      "message": "[error] Line 2031: 🔴 `propagated` only means `PublishProcessor.onNext` accepted the item; `ConversationFacade` consumes `dataTransfers` asynchronously through `observeOn(...).onBackpressureLatest()`. A terminal event can be dropped while the consumer is busy (or after it is disposed), so this branch skips `attachmentTransferOver` and the daemon request remains pending/suppressed forever. Settle the queue from the daemon event independently and keep a separate suppression marker until the facade handles the event, or make terminal delivery lossless.",
